----------------------------------------
- Do not install tests

11 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test18-V10-07-02)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst18PhysicsList : replaced stopping processes that have been deleted.

04 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test18-V10-07-01)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst18PhysicsList : replaced particle-specific inelastic hadronic
  processes (that have been deleted) with G4HadronInelasticProcess.

18 February 2021 Ben Morgan (test18-V10-07-00)
----------------------------------------------
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

05 August 2020  Alberto Ribon      (test18-V10-06-00)
-----------------------------------------------------
- test18.in , test18.large_N.in : migrated UI commands from "/grdm/..."
  to "/process/had/rdm/..."
- RadioactiveDecayGunmessenger : for consistency (although not necessary),
  migrated the (local) UI command "/grdm/ion" to "/process/had/rdm/ion".

