- Include G4Types before use of G4MULTITHREADED. For forward
  compatibility with move to #defines over -D for G4 preprocessor
  symbols.

24 January 2018 Gunter Folger      (test18-V10-04-00)
-----------------------------------------------------
- test18.in, test18.large_N.in: replace use of command /gun/ionL using level numbers with
     command /gun/ion using level energy

